What are Thin Film Lithium Niobate (TFLN) Modulators?
TFLN modulators represent a revolutionary advancement in electro-optic technology, delivering superior performance through innovative thin-film fabrication techniques. These cutting-edge devices outperform traditional bulk lithium niobate modulators with their ultra-high bandwidth capabilities exceeding 100GHz, compact form factors, and remarkably low insertion losses. Their true breakthrough lies in CMOS compatibility, which enables seamless integration into next-generation photonic circuits - a game-changer for optical communication systems.
